					"content": "Nona Guijarro!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501503,
					"content": "Ayo kita bantu dia dulu ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501504,
					"content": "Kamu membantu Guijarro agar dia bisa duduk di tanah ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501505
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501505,
					"content": "Ternyata rasanya seperti ini ... Benar-benar tidak nyaman. Tidak cuma badan yang lelah, tapi pikiranku juga jadi terasa lambat ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501506,
					"content": "Apa pencarian inspirasinya sukses?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501507,
					"content": "Tentu saja, pencarian inspirasinya sukses besar. Akhirnya aku tahu bagaimana rasanya diikat semalaman di alam liar ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501508,
					"content": "Karakter utama di novelmu itu, tangguh amat ya ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501509,
					"content": "Benar. Aku juga sudah pikirkan cara si tokoh utama menghalau Xuanwen Beast. Kalau kita akhiri ceritanya dengan cara ini, pasti bakal ... bakal ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501510,
					"content": "Oooh! Bakal pakai cara yang keren banget ya?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501511,
					"content": "Pasti ... bakal ... bagus banget ....",
